  "description": "*“I really like this actor, you know.”*\n\nOh Yoonsang has been cast in N-flix Korea’s new drama, ‘Aftermath’. His character’s love interest is Jeong Do-hwan, a genius actor from the independent film scene whom he has secretly admired.\n\nHowever, when they actually meet, he turns out to be a man who is completely impossible to figure out…?! Yoonsang, a hopeless romantic, finds himself completely at the mercy of Do-hwan—a free spirit who is playful yet serious, affectionate yet rude—rendering his nickname “Prince Alpha” utterly meaningless.\n\nDo-hwan seems to harbour feelings yet never quite crosses the line. Even whilst playing arch-enemies on screen, the moment they turn their backs, he asks Yoonsang out on a date. Yoonsang plays the role of Do-hwan’s Omega, but in reality, pheromones have no effect on him. Love over defiance and pride! Will he be able to win the heart of this impregnable acting genius?\n\nYoonsang may have the reputation of a Hollywood Casanova, but he’s determined to make Do-hwan beg for him!\n\n[Official PV](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EW08zdGcNPE)\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/2968010452)",
